&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7665&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of system design, data modeling, and software engineering fundamentals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7751&quot;&gt;Proven ability to simplify complex problems, make sound tradeoffs, and drive alignment across product, engineering, and design teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
