&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7886&quot;&gt;Strong sense of personal accountability with a track record of delivering high-quality, end-to-end products and raising team-wide technical standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
