&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8241&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8259&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8310&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
